`GET /v1/projects/{id}/platforms/sms/numbers/countries`

Lists supported purchase countries independently of current provider inventory. Requires platforms:read for the path project.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.projects.platforms.listNumberCountries(input: ListNumberCountriesInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<ListNumberCountriesOutput>
```
</Tab>
